# A grammar without a schema or @lang whose actions use more than 256
# distinct tags generates a Tag enum wide enough for them.

@lexer
tokens
    ident
    eof
    err
[a-zA-Z_][a-zA-Z0-9_]*                      → ident
.                                           → err

